#. むっ！
#. 苗木くんもここを捜しに来たのか！
msgctxt "0001 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Ah-ha! I see you came to search this area as well,\n"
"Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. しかし、一歩遅かったな！
msgctxt "0002 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "But you were one step too late!"
msgstr ""

#. すでに僕が調査済みだ。
#. 十神くんの<CLT 3>痕跡は一切なかった<CLT>ぞ！
msgctxt "0003 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"I've already finished my investigation. And <CLT 3>there was\n"
"no trace<CLT> of Byakuya here!"
msgstr ""

#. 腹が減っては戦はできん！
msgctxt "0004 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "An army marches on its stomach, as they say!"
msgstr ""

#. 従って、ここで腹を満たしているのかと
#. 推測したのだが…
msgctxt "0005 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"So I thought maybe he would come here to have his\n"
"fill..."
msgstr ""

#. くうっ！
#. よもや、痕跡すら見つけられないとは！
msgctxt "0006 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"We must all eat! Eat until there's nothing left to\n"
"eat!"
msgstr ""

#. が、くじけている暇はない！
#. 別の場所を捜しに向かおうじゃないか、苗木くん！
msgctxt "0007 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Anyway, now is no time to get discouraged. We must\n"
"head elsewhere to continue our search!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうだね…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, you're right..."
msgstr ""

#. くじけている暇はない！
#. 別の場所を捜しに向かおうじゃないか、苗木くん！
msgctxt "0009 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Now is no time to get discouraged. We must head\n"
"elsewhere to continue our search!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうだね…
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, you're right..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. これも、壊したら…罰があるのかもな…
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If I break it...Monokuma might come and punish *me*."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなカメラで…人が死ぬところも見てるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Someone's using these cameras to watch people die...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ムカツクけど、放っておくしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As much as it gets on my nerves, I'd better leave it\n"
"alone.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここの棚には、食べ物が並んでいる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all different kinds of food stacked up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>料理の食材からお菓子まで、よりどりみどりだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>From basic ingredients to snacks and candy, it's\n"
"everything anyone could ever want or need.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>生活必需品がごちゃごちゃと置かれている…
#. なんかテンション上がるよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all kinds of stuff piled up everywhere. I get\n"
"kinda excited looking at it all...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>生活必需品がごちゃごちゃと置かれている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all kinds of stuff piled up everywhere.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>生活必需品がごちゃごちゃと置かれている…
#. 自分で調達すると思うと面倒だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all kinds of stuff piled up everywhere. I\n"
"could never get half this stuff in the outside world.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは、冷蔵庫か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is this the fridge Sayaka mentioned?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>中には、飲み物や食料品が詰まっているな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's stuffed tight with food and drinks.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0023 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0024 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
